    <p>An ongoing pile of travel frames. No theme, no plan — just a Fujifilm X100F that follows me around, amazing places, and a lot of fun. Zero expertise, still figuring out the perfect recipe and what makes the perfect shot.</p>
    <div class="intro-meta">Fujifilm X100F <span class="em">·</span> Since 2024</div>

    <div class="intro-controls">
